<title>HONG KONG: Bakrie unit seeks yen financing.</title>
<headline>Bakrie unit seeks yen financing.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bakrie International Finance BV plans to issue a 12 billion yen Euro-yen guaranteed floating rate note, bankers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Peregrine Fixed Income is the arranger, they said.</p>
<p>The launch is expected next week. No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
